Z||000009||LEE498||05-15-99||04:24 PM||||Well,i haven't taking the car to the track,But we race all the time at our local hang out spot on the weekends.It's so much fun,some times we will have about 30-40 cars out there,kool cars,and cute chics.My girlfriend is an raceaholic she loves it!We can do that roun hea caus we's in tha kuntreeee!!hehawhehaw                                                            Stall speed,say 3000 means that your trans will slip until it reaches 3000 rpms, or what ever stall you select  then it will lock-up.It's kinda like an automatic clutch with no pedals.Highly recommened if racing an auto trans! 2400-2800 good street-strip converter that will definitely make a difference.Shift points are the same.As for the shift kit a would let an trans shop do it cause that valve body can get very ugly believe me I KNOW! you'll have to drop the trans to put converter in.I got my shift kit from the FIERO STORE for about $35.        
